fix:
Define a concrete Enum for command types, forcing parsing at the system boundary.
```rust
enum Command {
    Confirm,
    Cancel,
}

fn route_command(cmd: Command) {
    match cmd {
        Command::Confirm => process_confirmation(),
        Command::Cancel => process_cancellation(),
    }
}
```
